Package: Rmxdat
Title: Mexican Data for Monitoring Sustainable Development
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Federico", "Castro Monzon",
           email = "maintainer@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides documented datasets about Mexico to support
    analysis of sustainable development, social conditions, and
    state-level indicators. The initial focus is on datasets relevant
    to monitoring the United Nations Sustainable Development
    Cooperation Framework for Mexico, 2026-2031. Documentation records
    data sources, coverage, transformations, and reuse conditions.
    This is an independent project with no affiliation with the
    United Nations or the Mexican government.
